OL,3,GNEWSAPassports needed for ferries
OL,4,Abetween Wales and Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerry passengers travelling between
OL,7,FBritain and the Republic of Ireland now
OL,8,Fneed to show a valid passport before
OL,9,Fboarding.
OL,11,FPreviously, passengers were not always
OL,12,Fasked to show a passport but had
OL,13,Fsometimes been required to have another
OL,14,Fform of photo ID.
OL,16,FThe changes will affect about two and a
OL,17,Fhalf million passengers, including car
OL,18,Fand lorry drivers sailing from
OL,19,FHolyhead, Fishguard and Pembroke Dock.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
