OL,3,GNEWSAPassports needed for ferries
OL,4,Abetween Wales and Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerry companies Stena and Irish Ferries
OL,7,Fsaid they were making the change from
OL,8,FMonday to help them comply with UK
OL,9,Fgovernment rules on passenger lists.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
